    "rainbow-table-markdown-code-1": "value₀ = input[i]\nvalue₁ = fnv1a_hash(value₀)\nvalue₂ = fnv1a_hash(value₁)\n...\nvalueR = fnv1a_hash(valueR-1)\noutput[i] = valueR",
